necessary for the \emph{X} in the case of Protocol-2. However, we must
have some means to obtain \emph{X}1 in Type 3 when necessary. The
transformation will fail only when we are unable to do so.

In Protocol-2, \emph{X} can be part of the static data such as the
private key, the public key or the public parameters, or the
